  "query_preview": "/Tuesday through Saturday/...\nGradual day-to-day cooling should continue through Saturday \nwith temps finally lowering to normal or even slightly below \nnormal. Zonal flow aloft should push the monsoon moisture back \nsouth of our CWA on Tuesday, but a Pacific trough along the BC \ncoast will turn upper winds to southwesterly again Wednesday\nand beyond, with monsoon moisture again getting into our \nsouthern zones, with gradually increasing chances of showers\nand thunderstorms. Northern CWA zones should stay dry, however.",
